/// M08 CORE-044 "bundled transport loopback: roots green, 34 staged tests".
/// Source: tests/integration/transport_test.go symbol
/// TestBundledTransportLoopback (L13-38).
/// Related fixtures: the seven staged runtime suites named on the bun test
/// command line (L26): runtime/test/transport-body.test.ts (5 tests),
/// runtime/test/transport-request.test.ts (4), runtime/test/transport-owned.test.ts (3),
/// runtime/test/transport-fetch.test.ts (7), runtime/test/transport-http.test.ts (2),
/// runtime/test/transport-named.test.ts (8), runtime/test/transport-late.test.ts (5);
/// total 34. transport-budget.test.ts exists in the tree but is NOT staged
/// (absent from L26), so it contributes no root here.
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): the staged bun run is green with a passed report
/// carrying exactly 34 tests, grounded per suite in the seven staged
/// fixtures, with the fail-free verdict present.
/// Request-prep/fetch/owned/late semantics live in
/// core-044-transport-semantics.can; the production process shape lives in
/// core-044-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: none in this file (default only); the suite variants
/// (one-attempt, stalled body, redirect, malformed reply, late fault) live
/// in the transport-semantics file.
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec + localhost
/// bind/outbound; requires can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. Logical
/// gates SUITE/WORK/PROC and C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23/QHTTP; no
/// live run now. Descriptor timeout 120000ms mirrors the Go 2-minute ctx (L19).
/// Delegated oracles: DELEGATE-023 (transport-body.test.ts, 5
/// declarations), DELEGATE-029 (transport-request.test.ts, 4), DELEGATE-028
/// (transport-owned.test.ts, 3), DELEGATE-024 (transport-fetch.test.ts, 7),
/// DELEGATE-025 (transport-http.test.ts, 2), DELEGATE-027
/// (transport-named.test.ts, 8), DELEGATE-026 (transport-late.test.ts, 5);
/// read-only record, not executed here.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23/QHTTP unmet).
/// Case transport/loopback-roots checks: assert-green, report-passed,
/// root-count, fixture-name, body-roots, request-roots, owned-roots,
/// fetch-roots, http-roots, named-roots, late-roots.
/// Facet map (transport_test.go legs): assert-green pins the staged run
/// (L29-30: CombinedOutput error nil or "staged transport tests" fatals);
/// report-passed pins the fail-free verdict (L30: output contains "0 fail"
/// verbatim); root-count pins exactly 34 staged tests (the Go leg checks
/// the verdict only, so the count grounds per suite in the fixtures per
/// the CORE-045 precedent: 5 + 4 + 3 + 7 + 2 + 8 + 5); fixture-name grounds
/// the pins in the seven staged files (L26: the bun test file args in
/// order); body-roots pins the body suite (transport-body.test.ts L5/L27/
/// L51/L64/L75: cap/stall/deadline/bytes/precedence, 5); request-roots pins
/// the request suite (transport-request.test.ts L11/L31/L52/L88: encoding/
/// urls/credentials/snapshot, 4); owned-roots pins the owned suite
/// (transport-owned.test.ts L18/L44/L62: retain/cleanup/drain, 3);
/// fetch-roots pins the fetch suite (transport-fetch.test.ts L14/L68/L113/
/// L154/L188/L212/L277: attempt/redirect/stall/deadline/cancel/cap/boxed, 7);
/// http-roots pins the http suite (transport-http.test.ts L83/L127:
